---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | FileLocker Online" 
  description="Terms and conditions for using FileLocker online tools."
>
  <div class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] min-h-screen py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8 tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 space-y-6">
        <p><strong>Last Updated: August 2026</strong></p>

        <p>
          Welcome to FileLocker. By using our website and browser-based tools, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
        <p>
          By accessing filelocker.online, you accept these terms in full. If you disagree with these terms, you must not use our website.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Description of Service</h3>
        <p>
          FileLocker provides a free, client-side, browser-based file password protection and decryption utility. The service processes data entirely on the user's device and does not upload, store, or transmit user files to our servers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. User Responsibility for Passwords</h3>
        <p>
          Because FileLocker operates completely offline in your browser, we do not store or transmit your passwords. <strong>If you lose your password, the data protected by FileLocker cannot be recovered by us.</strong> You are entirely responsible for securely managing your passwords.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">4. Acceptable Use</h3>
        <p>
          You agree to use FileLocker only for lawful purposes. You must not use our tool to protect, distribute, or hide illegal, harmful, or malicious files.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
        <p>
          The service is provided "as is" and "as available". We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or completely secure. While we use industry-standard encryption protocols (AES-GCM), we are not liable for any data loss, corruption, or security breaches resulting from the use of our software or compromised user devices.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">6. Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p>
          In no event shall FileLocker be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including loss of profits, data, or use, arising out of or related to your use of the service.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">7. Monetization and Third-Party Links</h3>
        <p>
          Our website may display advertisements (e.g., via Google AdSense) or contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party services.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">8. Changes to Terms</h3>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify or replace these terms at any time. Continued use of the service after any such changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
